sequenceDiagram
  participant API
  participant S3 as Cloud.ru S3
  participant DB as PostgreSQL
  participant Worker as Recognizer
  API->>S3: PutObject оригинал
  API->>DB: photo и recognition
  Worker->>DB: аренда задания
  Worker->>S3: GetObject оригинал
  Worker->>S3: PutObject normalized
  Worker->>DB: результат
  API->>S3: подписанный GET
  Worker->>S3: DeleteObject по сроку
  S3-->>Worker: подтверждение
  Worker->>DB: file_state purged
